{"hw":"Σαλαμίνιος","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">Σαλαμίνιος</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">Σαλαμίν-ιος</span>, <span class=\"lex-itype gk\">α</span>, <span class=\"lex-itype gk\">ον</span>, also <span class=\"lex-itype gk\">ος</span>, <span class=\"lex-itype gk\">ον</span>, <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">Salaminian, of</b> or <b class=\"lex-tr\">from Salamis</b>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hdt.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">5.104</span> </span>, etc.: also <span class=\"lex-orth gk\">Σαλαμιν-ιακός</span>, <span class=\"lex-itype gk\">ή</span>, <span class=\"lex-itype gk\">όν</span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Str.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">8.2.2</span> </span>; and fem. <span class=\"lex-orth gk\">Σαλαμιν-ιάς</span>, <span class=\"lex-itype gk\">άδος</span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">A.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Pers.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">965</span> </span> (lyr.). </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"2\"><span class=\"lex-n\">II</span> <span class=\"gk\">Σαλαμινία</span> (sc. <span class=\"gk\">ναῦς</span> or <span class=\"gk\">τριήρης</span>), <span class=\"lex-gram\">ἡ</span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Ar.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Av.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">144</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Th.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">3.33</span> </span>; v. πάραλος <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">111</span> </span>.</div></div>"}